      "Patterns need data. For your first 30 active days you will see your streak and your local mood trend — and nothing else. After the threshold, Fathom surfaces the patterns too slow for a human to notice: weekday themes, day-after links, returning worries."
    <div className="row row--wrap" style={"gap":10}>
      <div aria-label="Step 2 of 3" className="dots" role="img">
        <span className="dots__dot">
        <span className="dots__dot dots__dot--on">
        <span className="dots__dot">
      <span className="note note--muted">
        "Step 2 of 3"
    <button className="btn btn--block" disabled=false type="button">
      "Next""
`;

